                                                "sense_id": "ba52abf2-4f6f-3593-b088-66243ee5baf5",
                                                "text": "Professional jealousies are always confined to the more ignorant; and education alone will enable us to rise above our catchpenny caterings to the prejudices and jealousies of the uninformed."
